[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS025
TITLE: Freeze conflicting routine clearances at a peak larger than the checked cap
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall freeze routine clearances that conflict with an emergency or a closed weather gate, and shall still issue other routine clearances that the probe and the guard accept. It shall audit routine phrases against the project grammar. A training peak shall control more than 8 aircraft without widening the checked envelope. Acceptance is nine training aircraft with the checked aircraft limit still 8, and a routine phrase that passes the audit.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Peak training is where a frozen conflict must not become a clearance, and where the small proof must stay intact.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Full approach control, enroute separation, LAHSO, PRM, visual-separation judgment, a live NAS connection, and certification remain outside the software.
